MODULE: TypeOKInvalidDemand
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: A request writes a value outside the finite request domain.
PERTURBS: Demand
--- FIND
    /\ demand' = "pending" /\ pending' = TRUE /\ armNeeded' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: invalid request state.
    /\ demand' = "invalid" /\ pending' = TRUE /\ armNeeded' = TRUE
--- END
